# Trial by Water (outlands 133): the battlefield won while accepted. With the Tuning Fork of Water, at WP_Entrance the
# fork opens the entry menu 32000; its update with option 1 (index 0, arena 1) registers and enters (the fork taken);
# Leviathan_Prime_TBW of arena 1 (LEVIATHAN_PRIME_ASA-21: mob 17641473; the zone's only IDs.lua mob key is 17641494) is
# killed, and the win's 32001 opens within the kill step. Its finish runs content:onEventFinishWin, which calls this
# quest: Heir of the Great Water, the Whisper of Tides. In Norg, Edal-Tahdal's 112 (the whisper, no fork) and option 5
# (10000 gil) complete it.
char zone=CloisterOfTides pos=557.5,35.1,563.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Outlands.TrialByWater accepted
keyitem TuningForkOfWater
login
trigger WP_Entrance                       # the fork: the entry menu 32000
update 32000 option=1                     # Trial by Water (index 0), arena 1: registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                    # in the arena
kill LEVIATHAN_PRIME_ASA-21               # Leviathan_Prime_TBW of arena 1: the battlefield won, 32001 opens
finish                                    # Heir of the Great Water, the Whisper of Tides
warp -13.0,1.1,-19.0 Norg
trigger Edal-Tahdal                       # the whisper, no fork: 112
finish option=5                           # 10000 gil: completed
